  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan reaches Jade Pool for literature carps raised there. Zhou Ping cups his fists, names himself, and stands in the way. Fang Yuan threatens that Zhou Ping’s cultivation is not fit to talk rules with him. Zhou Ping answers that he cannot defeat Fang Yuan, but that he has insights in flying and two immortal killer moves, and that even named experts cannot catch him easily. Fang Yuan watches him while considering his own weaker movement methods.",
